# Fixture: the `buff` goal, a `rep` goal's points and the `rep` and `buff`
# predicates (tests/playtest.test.js): the simulated player gains and loses
# the aura and earns the points, so every step plays through.
guide blessed/northshire
title Blessed Fixture
faction Alliance
race Human
levels 1-6
zone Elwynn Forest

step Northshire Abbey
  goto 48.2,42.0 "Northshire Abbey"

step A blessing
  when !buff 1126
  buff 1126 "Mark of the Wild"

step Until it wears off
  buff 1126 "Mark of the Wild" off

step Halfway through Friendly with Stormwind
  when !rep Stormwind Honored
  rep Stormwind Friendly+3000

step Then
  task "Go on"
